    "id": "c6-348",
    "view": {
      "mode": "multiple",
      "stem": "对 $f(x)=1.5\\cos(\\frac83x+\\frac\\pi9)$ 作导数及图象分析。记 $t=x+\\frac\\pi{24}$。以下哪些结论成立？各式中 $k\\in\\mathbb Z$。",
      "figure_ids": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "定义域为 $\\mathbb R$，值域为 $[-\\frac32,\\frac32]$，最小正周期为 $\\frac{3\\pi}4$。",
          "figure_ids": []
